Upstream: (not opened; line breaking, measured in WPS: with kinsoku off, two East Asian characters with spaces between them may break after the spaces, so a line may end with an opening bracket and its space (WPS breaks 根据《 山东 after the space); UAX #14 LB14 never breaks after an opening bracket, and with kinsoku on neither does WPS)
diff --git a/crates/layout/src/kinsoku.rs b/crates/layout/src/kinsoku.rs
